    <h2 id="combined">Putting It All Together — Defense in Depth</h2>

    <p>No single security control is sufficient on its own. <strong>Defense in Depth</strong> is the strategy of
      layering multiple security controls so that if one fails, others are still in place. Think of it as multiple moats
      around a castle — an attacker must breach every layer, not just one.</p>

